{"resourceIdentifier":"2844","resourceName":"Tanghe AMMS GHG Mitigation Project","description":"The project introduces new animal waste management systems (AWMSs) to treat the manure from 11 existing swine farms in Nanyang City, Henan Province. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons. \r\nAll the manure and wastewater are collected and then be separated first. The solid will be treated in aerobic composting system and the organic fertilizers will be produced, part of the fertilizer produced in this process will be distributed to local farmers for free and the others will be sold in domestic market. The liquid will be treated through anaerobic digestion and the biogas generated during the treatment process will be captured and sent to boilers for heat generation and Surplus biogas will be destroyed through the flaring system (if any). The sludge produced from anaerobic digestion will be treated through aerobic composting together with the solid, the effluent will be supplied to the farmers living around free for agriculture irrigation.\r\nIt is estimated that approximately 1,759 tons of animal manure will be handled daily by the AWMSs and 3,531.53*104m3 of biogas can be produced annually. Also, the generated heat through biogas will be only used for daily operation of the AWMSs and the 11 swine farms themselves and will not be provided to other users. For conservativeness, baseline emissions from heat generation are neglected.","location":{"latitude":32.677100,"longitude":113.072200},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-03-09","endExclusive":"2022-04-09","endInclusive":"2022-04-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2844"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Muyuan Foods Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"310169"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"27/12/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 20/10/2020 - 19/10/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=61802&IDKEY=3kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909385224958","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"PD-Tanghe AMMS GHG Mitigation Project-V02-20220218-clean.docx","uploadDate":"2022-02-21T02:58:05.313Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=59476&IDKEY=dq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfha82017404","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS Listing Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-12-31T07:15:39.947Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=81680&IDKEY=uiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfm112636720","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Joint-Project-Description-Monitoring-Report-Muanyuan_B Tanghe-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-12-27T18:31:43.617Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=76097&IDKEY=7